# Tailwind CSS

- Use utility classes directly in JSX/template
- Avoid `@apply` except in rare design-token cases
{{#if parameters.mobileFirst}}
- Design mobile-first; use `sm:`, `md:`, `lg:` breakpoints progressively
{{/if}}
{{#if parameters.useCva}}
- Use `class-variance-authority` for component variants
{{/if}}
- Extract repeated class strings into component props, not CSS files
- Use Tailwind's design tokens (spacing, colors) consistently
